# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: Accept an optional enters-as-copy replacement and choose the copied artifact.
# Forcing: Sculpting Steel is the only spell; Sol Ring and Arcane Signet keep the copy choice interactive.
# AI behavior: The opponent has no relevant actions or permanents, so every decision belongs to the human seat.
# Failure modes:
#   WIN = Sculpting Steel enters with Sol Ring's characteristics and play continues.
#   LOSE = The copy replacement is declined, selection fails, or the permanent does not enter.
#   TIMEOUT = The optional replacement or artifact selection cannot be answered.
# Card roles:
#   Sculpting Steel — opens the optional ETB-copy replacement and subsequent artifact choice.
#   Sol Ring — selected artifact and visible copied result.
#   Arcane Signet — legal alternative that prevents Forge from auto-selecting the only candidate.
#   Islands — pay the generic mana cost.
# Protocol path: Cast action, OptionalActionMessage/Resp, SelectNReq/Resp, then copied battlefield state.

[metadata]
